@keycloak = http://localhost:8080
@gateway = http://localhost:7000
@petId = bd591fac-4b2c-47bb-8d57-a2f317a42fc2

### Obtain a demo veterinarian token from Keycloak
POST {{keycloak}}/realms/petcare/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=petcare-demo&username=vet1&password=Vet123!

> {% client.global.set("petcare_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### Gateway health does not require a token
GET {{gateway}}/health

### Open the machine-readable Gateway API catalog (anonymous)
GET {{gateway}}/openapi

### OpenAPI documents exposed by the Gateway (anonymous)
GET {{gateway}}/openapi/pet.json

###
GET {{gateway}}/openapi/appointment.json

###
GET {{gateway}}/openapi/treatment.json

### Browser Swagger UI: http://localhost:7000/swagger

### Record an examination through Gateway -> Treatment Service
POST {{gateway}}/treatment/api/treatments
Authorization: Bearer {{petcare_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "petId": "{{petId}}",
  "ownerId": "d8ee7d11-6e26-40e0-a62c-a0a950402ba6",
  "veterinarianId": "f793a3bd-c804-4a6b-8940-f6a80a9e4a87",
  "appointmentId": null,
  "examinedAtUtc": "2026-08-14T09:35:00Z",
  "diagnosis": "Gateway end-to-end verified",
  "treatmentPlan": "No treatment required",
  "medications": [],
  "nextControlAtUtc": null,
  "notes": "Created through API Gateway"
}

### Read it through Gateway -> Treatment Service
GET {{gateway}}/treatment/api/treatments/pet/{{petId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{petcare_token}}

### Initialize Gateway -> MCP Server
POST {{gateway}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{petcare_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"initialize","params":{"protocolVersion":"2025-11-25","capabilities":{},"clientInfo":{"name":"rider-http-client","version":"1.0"}}}

### Call Gateway -> MCP -> Treatment Service
POST {{gateway}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{petcare_token}}
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2025-11-25
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"get_medical_history","arguments":{"petId":"{{petId}}"}}}
